
>> dier := Objekt nĳ. 
 
 dier by: ['name:'] dwaan: { :n
eigen namme := n.
}. 


dier name: ['Diva']. 
 
dier by: ['namme'] dwaan: { <- namme.
}.

>> kat := dier nĳ.
 
 kat name: ['Diva']. 
 
 kat by: ['namme'] dwaan: { <- ['jo keninklike heechheid ']
+ (sels namme).
}.

Utfier skriuwe: kat namme.
